{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
<style>
:root{
 --bg:#f7f6f4;
 --card:#fff;
 --accent:#6c5ce7;
 --muted:#6b6b6b;
 --radius:12px;
 --maxw:900px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
 margin:0;
 font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;
 background-color:var(--bg);
 color:#222;
 line-height:1.4;
 background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='400' height='400' viewBox='0 0 400 400'><defs><pattern id='p' width='40' height='40' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><rect width='40' height='40' fill='%23f7f6f4'/><circle cx='20' cy='20' r='2' fill='%23e6e4ea'/></pattern></defs><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' fill='url(%23p)'/><g opacity='0.6' fill='none' stroke='%23e9e7ff' stroke-width='1'><path d='M0 120 Q100 60 200 120 T400 120' /><path d='M0 300 Q100 240 200 300 T400 300' /></g></svg>");
 background-attachment:fixed;
}
.container{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:32px auto;padding:24px}
.header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.logo{
 width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a29bfe);
 display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:20px;
 box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(108,92,231,0.12)
}
nav{margin-left:auto}
nav a{margin:0 8px;color:#333;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.hero{
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,0.6));
 padding:20px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:var(--radius);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;align-items:start;
}
.hero h1{margin:0;font-size:22px}
.card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,32,0.06)}
.meta{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
a.cta{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin-top:20px;align-items:start}
.section{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease}
.section.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
.form-row{display:flex;gap:8px}
.form-row>div{flex:1}
label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--muted)}
input[type="text"],select,textarea,input[type="number"]{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e7e5eb;background:white}
textarea{min-height:80px}
.small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
.button{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid #ddd;color:#333}
.plan-output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f2f2f6;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #e1e1e6;min-height:140px;overflow:auto}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
.footer-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}
@media (max-width:880px){.hero,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.logo{width:52px;height:52px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
 <header class="header">
  <div class="logo">TS</div>
  <div>
   <div class="meta">Private Practice Therapy</div>
   <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
  </div>
  <nav>
   <a href="index.html">Home</a>
   <a href="about.html">About</a>
   <a href="specialties.html">Ways I Work</a>
   <a href="fees.html">Fees &amp; Sessions</a>
   <a href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
   <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
  </nav>
 </header>

 <main>
  <section class="hero section" id="hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Connect about therapy, scheduling, or questions</h1>
      <p class="meta">A warm, practical conversation to help you decide if we might work well together. I work with adults facing transitions, anxiety, low mood, relationship strain, and parenting challenges.</p>
      <div class="card contact-list">
        <div><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick questions</h3>
      <p class="small">If you prefer, text or email to ask about availability or whether I accept your insurance.</p>
      <p class="small"><strong>Hours:</strong> Mon–Fri, by appointment</p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <section class="card section" id="planner">
      <h2>Session Planner</h2>
      <p class="small">Build a simple session plan you can bring to an initial call or keep for your records.</p>
      <form id="plannerForm" aria-label="Session Planner">
        <div class="form-row">
          <div>
            <label for="concern">Primary focus</label>
            <select id="concern" required>
              <option>Choosing a focus</option>
              <option>Anxiety &amp; Worry</option>
              <option>Low Mood</option>
              <option>Life Transition</option>
              <option>Relationship Stress</option>
              <option>Parenting Challenges</option>
              <option>Work &amp; Burnout</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="frequency">Typical frequency</label>
            <select id="frequency">
              <option>Weekly</option>
              <option>Biweekly</option>
              <option>Monthly check-ins</option>
              <option>As-needed / Brief series</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row" style="margin-top:10px">
          <div>
            <label for="length">Session length</label>
            <select id="length">
              <option>45 minutes</option>
              <option>60 minutes</option>
              <option>90 minutes</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="estimate">Estimated number of sessions</label>
            <input id="estimate" type="number" min="1" value="6">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:10px">
          <label for="goals">Goals you'd like to work on</label>
          <textarea id="goals" placeholder="E.g., reduce worry, improve sleep, regain focus"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:10px">
          <label for="notes">Other notes or preferences</label>
          <textarea id="notes" placeholder="Anything that feels important to share"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <button type="button" class="button" id="buildPlan">Create plan</button>
          <button type="button" class="button ghost" id="resetPlan">Reset</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="plan-output" id="planOutput" aria-live="polite">Your plan will appear here when you click "Create plan".</div>
        <div class="actions" style="margin-top:10px">
          <button class="button" id="copyPlan">Copy plan</button>
          <button class="button ghost" id="downloadPlan">Download .txt</button>
        </div>
        <p class="note">Note: This planner is a starting point and does not replace assessment. Confidentiality applies, but does not cover imminent risk; if you or someone else is in crisis, call emergency services or your local crisis line.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="card section" id="contactFormCard">
      <h3>Send a message</h3>
      <form action="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" method="post" enctype="text/plain" id="contactForm">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input id="name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name">
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" type="text" name="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}">
        <label for="message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="How can I help?"></textarea>
        <div class="actions" style="margin-top:8px">
          <button class="button" type="submit">Send</button>
          <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="button ghost">Call {{PHONE}}</a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div class="footer-note">
        <p><strong>Confidentiality & scope</strong>: Sessions are confidential within legal and ethical limits. I do not provide emergency services. If you are experiencing a crisis or are at immediate risk, please contact emergency services or a crisis line in your area.</p>
        <p>Privacy practices are available on request; clinical notes are retained according to professional guidelines.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

 </main>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
 'use strict';
 // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
 var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
 var sections = document.querySelectorAll('.section');
 if(prefersReduced){
   sections.forEach(function(s){ s.classList.add('reveal'); });
 } else if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
   var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
     entries.forEach(function(entry){
       if(entry.isIntersecting){
         entry.target.classList.add('reveal');
         obs.unobserve(entry.target);
       }
     });
   }, {threshold:0.12});
   sections.forEach(function(s){ obs.observe(s); });
 } else {
   sections.forEach(function(s){ s.classList.add('reveal'); });
 }

 // Session Planner logic
 var buildBtn = document.getElementById('buildPlan');
 var resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetPlan');
 var copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyPlan');
 var downloadBtn = document.getElementById('downloadPlan');
 var output = document.getElementById('planOutput');

 function assemblePlan(){
   var concern = document.getElementById('concern').value;
   var freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
   var length = document.getElementById('length').value;
   var estimate = document.getElementById('estimate').value;
   var goals = document.getElementById('goals').value.trim();
   var notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();

   var lines = [];
   lines.push('Session Plan — ' + concern);
   lines.push('');
   lines.push('Primary focus: ' + concern);
   if(goals) lines.push('Goals: ' + goals);
   lines.push('Recommended rhythm: ' + freq);
   lines.push('Session duration: ' + length);
   lines.push('Estimated sessions: ' + (estimate || 'TBD'));
   if(notes) lines.push('Notes: ' + notes);
   lines.push('');
   lines.push('How we might approach the work:');
   lines.push('- Start with clear, practical aims and regular reviews of progress.');
   lines.push('- Combine skills practice with reflective conversation.');
   lines.push('');
   lines.push('Practical items:');
   lines.push('- Modality: In-person or Telehealth, as agreed.');
   lines.push('- Fees, cancellation, and insurance details discussed at intake.');
   lines.push('');
   lines.push('Confidentiality & boundaries:');
   lines.push('Conversations are confidential within legal and ethical limits. The clinician does not provide emergency services. For imminent risk, contact emergency services or a crisis line.');
   lines.push('');
   lines.push('Prepared by: ' + '{{BUSINESS_NAME}}');

   var text = lines.join(String.fromCharCode(10));
   output.textContent = text;
   return text;
 }

 buildBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
   assemblePlan();
 });

 resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
   document.getElementById('plannerForm').reset();
   output.textContent = 'Your plan will appear here when you click "Create plan".';
 });

 copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
   var text = output.textContent || '';
   if(!text){ return; }
   if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){
     navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
       copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
       setTimeout(function(){ copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy plan'; }, 1800);
     }).catch(function(){ fallbackCopy(text); });
   } else {
     fallbackCopy(text);
   }
 });

 function fallbackCopy(text){
   var ta = document.createElement('textarea');
   ta.value = text;
   document.body.appendChild(ta);
   ta.select();
   try{ document.execCommand('copy');
     copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
     setTimeout(function(){ copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy plan'; }, 1800);
   } catch(e){ alert('Copy failed'); }
   document.body.removeChild(ta);
 }

 downloadBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
   var text = output.textContent || '';
   if(!text) return;
   var blob = new Blob([text], {type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
   var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
   var a = document.createElement('a');
   a.href = url;
   a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
   document.body.appendChild(a);
   a.click();
   document.body.removeChild(a);
   URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
 });

})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
"}
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the private practice therapist template.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — Contact page with an interactive Session Planner and a scroll-triggered reveal system.

Key features
- Session Planner widget: build a personalized plan, view a plaintext summary, copy to clipboard, or download as a .txt file. The planner is intended as a planning tool and not a substitute for clinical assessment.
- Scroll-triggered section reveal: uses IntersectionObserver and respects prefers-reduced-motion. If a visitor prefers reduced motion the page will show sections immediately without animation.
- Accessible, local-only implementation: no external libraries or CDNs required. All interactive logic is inlined JavaScript inside contact.html.

Placeholders to replace
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Behavior notes
- The contact form is a simple mailto fallback to allow quick messaging; in production replace with a secure form handler if you need server-side processing or storage.
- The Session Planner generates a plaintext plan that includes a short clinician-style framing, practical items, confidentiality reminders, and a crisis note. The text should be reviewed and adjusted to match your practice policies before distribution.

Clinical and legal reminders
- The content intentionally avoids medical claims and guarantees. It includes a confidentiality statement and an explicit crisis notice directing people to emergency services when needed.
- Make sure your privacy policies, fees, and cancellation terms are provided elsewhere on the site or during intake.

Testing
1. Open contact.html in a browser (file:// or via local server).
2. Scroll the page to observe reveal animations; enable "Reduce motion" in your OS to confirm prefers-reduced-motion behavior.
3. Use the Session Planner to build a plan, then click Copy plan and Download .txt to confirm export functionality.

Customization
- Update placeholders with your practice information.
- Adjust the Session Planner options and copy to reflect your therapeutic approach and administrative details.

Notes for developers
- The decorative SVG pattern is embedded as a data URI in the page styles so no external assets are required for this chunk.
- All scripts are written to be small and dependency-free. If integrating into a larger site, consider moving scripts into separate files and bundling as desired.
"} 
